    "body": "Readings (release, the issue's region, load 0.5): the plan took 29.6 s before the fix and takes 9.8 s after it. In debug it takes 60.2 s after the fix. The cause is a slow path, not a hang. The door search of the routed microlift returns took 16 s. It read the leg law on each free cell within 6 mm, also from points whose start disc holds stock, where no leg can pass. The output is identical by hash on nine cases.\n\nfix on issue/2736-adaptive-load-hang · PR #2757 · pinned by machining2d::adaptive::route::tests::a_door_on_stock_reads_no_leg, machining2d::adaptive::route::tests::the_door_is_the_nearest_legal_cell · merges when reviewed\n",
